[PrintTextModified Text:一到早上的开锁时间，<br>艾玛就伸着懒腰走出了房门。|#0101Adv23_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女大概还没睡醒。<br>地下包裹在一片寂静之中。|#0101Adv23_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（大早上要不要散散步呢）|#0101Adv23_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，过道远处<br>出现了一位正在走动的少女身影。|#0101Adv23_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:是安安。她正向艾玛这边走来，<br>几乎不带声响。|#0101Adv23_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:早上好安安。<br>你起得好早！身体怎么样了？|#0101Adv23_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Pensive1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:看到艾玛后，<br>安安皱起眉头，看着相当不开心。|#0101Adv23_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv23_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她决意要无视艾玛，<br>从艾玛身边走过，准备回自己的房间。|#0101Adv23_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（还以为稍微有和她更亲近一点……<br>　看来和她相处不会太顺利呢）|#0101Adv23_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [stopBgm]
; ========================================

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:安安低着头继续走路，<br>走到自己房门前才抬起头来。这时——|#0101Adv23_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:啊、啊、啊……！|#0101Adv23_AnAn002| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？|#0101Adv23_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Fearful1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！|#0101Adv23_AnAn003| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:安安震惊地瞪大了眼睛，<br>第一次喊出声来。|#0101Adv23_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:对安安的反应感到好奇，艾玛也跟着望向隔壁的房间。<br>然后，她也看到了。|#0101Adv23_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

