@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1,ArmR13,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么、为什么为什么为什么……|#0101Adv23_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Fearful1,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:大家冷静下来！|#0101Adv23_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和嘴里说的话相反，蕾雅满脸写着震惊。|#0101Adv23_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她打开诺亚的房门，<br>往里看了一眼，十分沉痛地摇了摇头。|#0101Adv23_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没救了……已经死了……为什么！！|#0101Adv23_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 14：フクロウの通知音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:就好像是挑准了时间一样，<br>手机的提示音回荡在过道之中。|#0101Adv23_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『唉……收到一份报告。<br>　据说发生了一起令人痛心的凶杀案啊』|#0101Adv23_Narrative022|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『大家注意，请大家立即前往会客厅集合。<br>　不遵守者将被看守带走……』|#0101Adv23_Narrative023|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如典狱长所说，<br>看守已经抵达过道。|#0101Adv23_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的脑袋乱作一团，<br>身体里好像有什么东西堵住似的，连呼吸都变得不太顺畅。|#0101Adv23_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但因为看守在场的关系，<br>少女们只好动身前往指定地点。|#0101Adv23_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没有任何人说话。<br>大家的脸上都没有任何表情。|#0101Adv23_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这件事，<br>似乎改变了少女们的一切。|#0101Adv23_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

